Version: 1.0
desc: Major General MIDI (Sonivox EAS port) by chmaha
tags: instrument
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  General MIDI synthesizer with 16 multitimbral channels, 128 GM instruments and a drum kit, up to 256 voices (default 64),
  the original reverb and chorus (per-channel CC91/CC93 sends or the whole mix), GM/master-volume SysEx,
  A4 tuning and 80 historical temperaments (as in Sonata Chamber Organ) on the melodic channels.
  Ported from the Sonivox EAS wavetable synthesizer (the Android MIDI synth, Sonic Network Inc. and
  The Android Open Source Project), including its built-in GM sound bank
  https://github.com/pedrolcl/sonivox (Apache License 2.0)
  The engine runs at 44.1 kHz with the original integer arithmetic and matches it sample for sample;
  other host rates are resampled.
  Original DSP Copyright (c) 2004-2006 Sonic Network Inc. Licensed under the Apache License v2: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/MajorGeneralMIDI/MajorGeneralMIDI.flac

